msgstr "परत “{}” हटाना"

#: src/actions.rs:897
msgid "Choose layer"
msgstr "परत चुनना"

#: src/actions.rs:902
msgid ""
"New annotations go to a regular layer; count points and HPF fields have "
"their own."
msgstr ""
"नए एनोटेशन किसी सामान्य परत में जाते हैं; गणना बिंदुओं और HPF फ़ील्ड की अपनी अलग परतें "
"होती हैं।"

#. Translators: an undo step, shown by eov as "Undo {}".
#: src/actions.rs:918
msgid "Clear counts"
msgstr "गणनाएँ साफ़ करना"

#: src/actions.rs:950
msgid ""
"There are no HPF fields on this slide yet. Use the HPF field tool (H) to "
